WEBVTT

00:21:58.956 --> 00:22:00.116
This is it.

00:22:00.116 --> 00:22:01.756
If we don't stand up now,

00:22:01.796 --> 00:22:05.756
there is no other time
when we can stand up.

00:22:05.796 --> 00:22:07.036
If we don't do it now,

00:22:07.036 --> 00:22:09.116
when are we ever going
to be able to do it?"

00:22:09.156 --> 00:22:11.156
So they're very, very clear about that.

00:22:11.156 --> 00:22:14.436
As you know, there's been some
talk around the world,

00:22:14.476 --> 00:22:19.316
some talk in the US and Europe, elsewhere
that maybe, you know,

00:22:19.316 --> 00:22:22.396
particularly after the liberation
of Kherson by the Ukrainians,

00:22:22.436 --> 00:22:25.196
shouldn't the Ukrainians sit down
at the negotiating table?

00:22:25.236 --> 00:22:26.916
So I asked President Zelensky that,

00:22:26.956 --> 00:22:30.116
and he said, "Look,
we're happy to negotiate,